	(text "x14: DB0-7, DBP, ATN, BSY, ACK, RST, SEL (pages 9-21 except MSG). References: page x 100 + n.\nDriver: GATE high = line asserted (Q1 pulls it to ~0.2 V). Receiver: RX low = line asserted\n(the RP2350 pad inverts it). Place this cluster on its own bus trace next to the connector." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6b8cf12e-7308-5688-b192-7a5ca9dae727"))
